  "scope": "Original normalized mean-zero law, actual bounded conditional law and actual future/noise kernel. Full-space all w/q true odd first/even nested second derivative bounds for source early i<=n/2 and long remaining clock T>=max(L2*gamma^2,y^2), gamma<=y<=2. Universal constants C,epsilon0,L2 precede every law. epsilon0 explicitly pays outside-v nonstationarity and early remaining-clock guard; no mean0/symmetry of conditional law. Actual Gaussian and full(c) spectra, k0 sine mark, four regions and source moment/clock payments. Universal differentiability retains m=0. Does not claim short-time five-region/time-integral bounds, large-y regime, probability comparison or C1/C2 closure."
